# EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689) — obligation mapping — version 2026.10.0
# https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/eu-ai-act  (this version: https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/eu-ai-act/2026.10.0)
